es of war. Geist is an M.D.S. (Most Dangerous Soldier), an enhanced human with unsurpassed combat capabilities and an insatiable lust for battle. Because of his uncontrollable nature, Geist is cryogenically frozen and locked in a satellite. Several years later, the satellite crashes and Geist wakes up from his sleep to engage in another war. This time, to help the army stop the planet's central computer from activating a doomsday device that will lead to total annihilation of all life on Jerra.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)\n\nNote: A Director's Cut version was released on March 1, 1996, containing a new Intro and Outro leading into the sequel"},"tags":[{"name":"Military","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Post-Apocalyptic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Motorcycles","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anti-Hero","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":72,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"MD Geist - The Most Dangerous Ever","english":"MD Geist - The Most Dangerous Ever","native":"装鬼兵ＭＤガイスト","romaji":"Soukihei MD Geist","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"装鬼兵M.D.ガイスト"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"装鬼兵M.D GEIST"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"装鬼兵"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"M.D. Geist"}]},"trailer":{"id":"96bWAh_cr3w","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/96bWAh_cr3w/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}